-names></name><name><surname>Wiig</surname><given-names>&#x000d8;</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Organochlorines in top predators at Svalbard &#x000d8; occurrence, levels and effects</article-title><source>Toxicol Lett</source><year>2000</year><volume>112&#x000d8;113</volume><fpage>103</fpage><lpage>109</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10720718</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0378-4274(99)00256-8</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>